# Scout for Survivors: "up to three target creature cards with total mana value 3 or less". Wheel of Fortune puts Llanowar
# Elves (1), Guerrilla Gorilla (2), Hired Blade (3) and Yargle, Glutton of Urborg (5) in the graveyard. Gorilla + Elves is exactly 3 and is
# accepted with two targets, fewer than three; Hired Blade with Elves (4) and Yargle, Glutton of Urborg alone (5) are past the limit and are
# refused (CR 601.2c, 202.3). The Elves and the Gorilla enter with a +1/+1 counter each; Hired Blade and Yargle, Glutton of Urborg stay.

